              color:#414141;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB'>. Based on your Submissions, the Bank
              will assess your firm against Bank information security criteria. Scores are
              used by the Bank to assist in a certification determination and the firmÕs
              overall adherence to its commitments to the Bank under the Retainer Agreement.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

