              </span></span></span><![endif]><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
              style='font-size:11.5pt;font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
              color:#414141;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB'>Certification</span></b><span
              style='font-size:11.5pt;font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
              color:#414141;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB'>. The Bank, in its discretion, upon
              completion of its assessment, may grant you a SEAL certification (<b
              style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>Certification</b>). Certification means
              that Bank has completed its assessment of the firmÕs information security
              practices and policies based on the Submission and other information collected
              as contemplated herein and has concluded that the firm appears to meet the
              minimum requirements of the Bank. The Bank has no obligation to grant SEAL
              certification to firm. The Bank reserves the right to suspend or terminate a
              Retainer Agreement and work conducted by the firm for the Bank if the
              assessment process reveals security threats or risks to the BankÕs Confidential
              Information or information security systems or otherwise that the firm is unable
              to timely remediate to the satisfaction of the Bank, all of which will be as
              determined by the Bank in it is sole discretion. <span
              style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp;</span>You acknowledge and agree that any
              assessment of your Submission and any Certification issued by the Bank through
              the Service is for the BankÕs internal assessment purposes only and: (a) does
              not constitute the BankÕs certification that the firm is actually in compliance
              with its obligations to the Bank under the Retainer Agreement or otherwise; (b)
              does not relieve the firm from its obligations concerning information security
              and the protection of Bank Confidential Information under the Retainer
              Agreement or otherwise.<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span><o:p></o:p></span></p>

