              <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:18.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:
              inter-ideograph;line-height:15.6pt;background:white'><span
              style='font-size:11.5pt;font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
              color:#414141;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB'>(a)<span style='mso-tab-count:1'> </span>In
              these Terms <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>Firm Data</b> means all data
              and documents supplied or provided by, imported or uploaded to, or generated
              by, or otherwise made available to the Bank by the firm in connection with the
              firmÕs use of the Service and its Submission, and <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:
              normal'>Analytics Data</b> means (a) Firm Data that has been de-identified,
              aggregated or anonymized; and (b) any data generated or derived by the Bank in
              connection with the BankÕs analysis of the Firm Data and firm Submission that
              does not identify the firm. By way of example, and without limitation,
              Analytics Data may include the identity of a particular third party virus
              detection tool used by the firm.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

              <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:18.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:
