              <p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:18.0pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:
              inter-ideograph;line-height:15.6pt;background:white'><span
              style='font-size:11.5pt;font-family:Arial;mso-fareast-font-family:"Times New Roman";
              color:#414141;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB'>(c)<span style='mso-tab-count:1'> </span>The
              firm may elect to redact documents submitted as part of Firm Data. Firm Data
              files cannot be downloaded or viewed after upload to the Service. The firm can,
              however, replace an uploaded file by deleting it and re-uploading a new file.
              The Bank will only store Firm Data until Certification is achieved, at which
              time the Firm Data, other than Analytics Data, will be destroyed by the Bank.
              The Bank will notify you by email confirming that the Firm Data has been
              destroyed. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

